  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/714/118/mighty_mail_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1100\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/502/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Forge\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/503/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Fabric\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/504/mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"Requires Framework\" width=\"222\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mrcrayfish.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/500/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish&#x27;s Website\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/MrCrayfishMinecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/793/499/_x__xampp_htdocs_mrcrayfish.png\" alt=\"MrCrayfish&#x27;s YouTube\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/mrcrayfish\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/336389026586165261?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&logoColor=902121\" alt=\"MrCrayfish&#x27;s Discord\"></a></p>\n<h5>📖 <strong>關於</strong></h5>\n<p>Mighty Mail 是即將推出的改版《MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod》中郵件系統的獨立版本。該郵件系統用途廣泛，值得擁有自己的模組。這讓您可以不必安裝整個裝飾類模組，僅為了使用這個優秀的功能。在本模組中，您將找到以各種木材類型製作的郵箱和收件箱。郵箱允許您向伺服器上的其他玩家發送郵件。您可以向放置在世界的任何郵件箱中包含物品和可選訊息。它還可以跨維度運作。當您收到郵件時，您的郵件箱旁會出現一面小紅旗。為了自訂您的體驗，配置選項允許您更改郵件箱的庫存大小並增加最大交付隊列限制。</p>\n<h5>🎨 <strong>截圖</strong></h5>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/714/131/screenshot1-1.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/714/132/screenshot2-1.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/714/133/screenshot3-1.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"632\"></strong></p>",
